    -fno-pic -fstack-protector-strong; the callees are separate stubs):

        switch (op) { case 7..11, 13: integer path; case 4, 5: float path;
                      default: int-or-float path }   /* every path: res->tt = K; return; */
        trybinTM(L, p1, p2, res, op + 6);

